{"title":"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A triangle and a trapezoid are equal in area. They also have the same altitude. If the base of the triangle is 18 inches, the median of the trapezoid is: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/a/51ac79e0657e73cefa8977d60d5e8411df95ca75.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 36\\text{ inches} \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 9\\text{ inches} \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 18\\text{ inches}\\\\  \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{not obtainable from these data}\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{none of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"421\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We know that the area of a trapezoid is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/9/2b9672bd3203025cb26c543b3b8c0cb324daf9a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$mh$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> is the median and the area of a triangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/e/2ce4b902246a68e80a0f0417d8072f96cde6fb0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{bh}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"39\" />. We know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/b/4cbfba62e8ac5c2da5ffa98264d2e32b225b8780.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=18$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"49\" height=\"13\" /> and the height of the trapezoid is congruent to the height of the triangle. Thus, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/7/b776fe447263b3b96794d5b6b00b8cd6ffc8f4a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{18h}{2}=9h=mh$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"126\" height=\"37\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/f/43f097dbc216f68ad8a86a06b924d3dc61eef655.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m=\\textbf{(B) }9\\text{ inches}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"133\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME\" title=\"1953 AHSME\">1953 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1953 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1953\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\"